```

### Solution: Use MCP Tools

Tools automatically:
- ✅ Detect file type (Dir/Grid/Filter)
- ✅ Detect if Grid Detail (needs parent form)
- ✅ Generate correct function name (onChange$Voucher$ma_kh)
- ✅ Use correct API (f.getItemValue vs g._getItemValue)
- ✅ Handle parent form access:
```javascript
